window.products.push({"id":318200,"name":"OKD 48'' Coffee Table with Storage & Sliding Barn Doors, Farmhouse & Industrial Cocktail Table w/Adjustable Shelves, Rectangular Rustic Living Room Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yVWfcn2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CHIC INDUSTRIAL& FARMHOUSE STYLE: Product Measured: 48\"W × 22\"D× 19\"H. This rectangular OKD coffee table garners attention with its sliding mesh-barn doors. It features a perfect blend of industrial and modern farmhouse styles. The reclaimed Barnwood finish delivers a naturally aged feel and creates a cozy and retro vibe. With hidden shelved storage behind its sliding doors, you'll love the extra space for storing items you want to keep within reach. This cocktail table is perfect for any rustic, cottage, shabby chic, or casual space. Coordinate your space with an additional OKD mesh-door living room set with functionality to elevate your living room's charm. (Sold Separately). SLIDING BARN DOORS: Featuring two removable barn doors for convenient slide and space-saving. The sliding barn doors are designed with inset metal mesh and dark iron tone hardware for added charm and aesthetic, giving the table a characteristic look. Quality slide ensures smooth slide for convenient access to cabinets while space saving. You can also choose to slide the door to any side to conceal side storage cabinets or the middle open-cubby for a clean, organized look PLENTY OF STORAGE: Measuring a 48'' wide by 22 '' depth tabletop, it is more spacious compared with most of the coffee tables in the market. Each side cabinet and the middle open cubby has a removable and adjustable shelf (3 heights adjustable) enabling you to customize your storage space. Perfect when you want to have different-sized items as needed store books, magazines, throws, remote controllers, electronics, decors, and more at hand when you relax on your sofa BUILT TO LAST: Thanks to the high-grade engineered wood and well-structured design, this table can withstand the challenge of long-term use. The thickened tabletop with 1.18'' can hold up to 150 pounds and can easily accommodate your items with no problems. What's more, the enhanced 4 support legs plus one extra mid-leg further enhance the stability and weight-bearing capacity of the coffee table, with 100% No Wobble. PACKAGE, ASSEMBLY, AND SERVICE: This coffee table will be shipped directly from our US LOCAL WAREHOUSE. Your table will be packaged in a secure box that contains foam and wood protective boards surrounding it, this provides maximum protection against shipping damage. It comes with clear step-by-step illustrated instructions and is marked with numbers or letters on each piece of hardware and parts to find the parts you need easily. Assembly needs to take 45-90 minutes. (2 Adults are required).In case of any problem or you are not satisfied, please contact us without hesitation, we will always reply within 24 hours and provide satisfactory solutions","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yVWfcn2IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKD","source_asin":"B0C23YV3JQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23YV3JQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23YV3JQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
