window.products.push({"id":318221,"name":"Salem Complete Wood Daybed with Euro Top Deck and Trundle Bed Pop-Up Frame, Mahogany Finish, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OgwsUqL3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Salem daybed is certainly bewitching...but in a most pleasant way. Constructed of solid environment-friendly Plantation hardwood, this beautifully honed frame looks as if it was carved from an old-fashioned anvil of a skilled woodcrafter. The 35.75-inch back panel slightly curves and the 30.25-inch side panels have sleigh arms that bend outward, welcoming those who want to sit or sleep. Probably the first thing you notice about the Salem daybed is its exquisite Mahogany finish. The rich tone has a beautiful blend of dark brown and red—formal and yet hospitable. The lovely, hand-rubbed patina literally beckons you into a room. The Salem daybed has been smoothly sculpted to be a fine piece of furniture and definitely adds an element of beauty to any room in your house. A 12-inch space between the floor and daybed base will store the included Trundle Bed Pop-Up Frame. This unit measures 35.75-inches (H) x 87.5-inches (W) x 39.5-inches (L), and includes a Euro top deck, back panel, (2) side panels, pop-up frame, instructions, and hardware bag with everything needed for assembly. A mattress is not included with this daybed. The Fashion Bed Group Salem Complete Daybed comes with a 10-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OgwsUqL3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B008MH7KPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008MH7KPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008MH7KPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
