window.products.push({"id":318266,"name":"RTBM ice cube tray with lid ,BPA Free 32 grids small ice cube trays Easy to release，Stackable Durable silicone ice cube tray with Lid and ice storage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f40lRrG1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ice cube tray set: The package contains a lid, a 32-cell silicone ice tray, an ice box and a spoon. 4 colors (yellow, white, pink, blue) Multi-layer stacking: In the ice tray between the lid and the ice storage box, you can add multiple ice trays of any color, which greatly saves space. Safety materials: Trays and boxes are made of silicone and PP, and have passed LFGB, BPA Free certification. Low temperature resistance. Lid and ice cube storage box: The lid can perfectly cover the mold and ice cube storage box. The sealed ice making environment is not affected by other foods in the refrigerator and maintains their original flavor. The transparent ice storage box allows you to know how many ice cubes are left at any time to keep you cool. Easy to use: The silicone material can easily remove the ice cubes from the mold, and the spoon can make you more hygienic to take out the ice cubes to be used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f40lRrG1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RTBM","source_asin":"B0963S5WB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0963S5WB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0963S5WB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":318267,"name":"Household Essentials Animal Kingdom Storage Trunks (Set of 2), Jumbo/Medium, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91esy0sevwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Household Essentials Animal Kingdom Storage Trunks bring the wild of Africa right to your home. This set of trunks comes with one jumbo trunk featuring a beautiful zebra and one medium trunk with a regal tiger. These attractive storage trunks have spacious interiors for easy and convenient storage. They are hard-sided and lightweight, so they are sturdy yet movable, with two attached brown, faux-leather handles and brass studded accents. Reminiscent of steamer trunks and travel trunks, these dynamic storage trunks are the perfect way to attractively and stylishly store your extra stuff. Each sturdy trunk is lined with a black, polypropylene liner to protect its contents. The attractive decoupage finish is smooth with just enough sheen to catch the light. The zebra jumbo trunk is 15.75 inches high, 27.2 inches wide, and 16.93 inches deep. The tiger medium trunk is 8.85 inches high, 19.29 inches wide, and 11.02 inches deep. Check out these trunks in Large and Small and in a Vanity Box Set too!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91esy0sevwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B019JR5CT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019JR5CT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019JR5CT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
