window.products.push({"id":318393,"name":"GRANNY SAYS Oval Bathroom Floor Mat, Bath Mats for Bathroom Non-Slip, Chenille Extra Soft Water Absorbent Shaggy Bath Rugs, Machine Wash Fast Dry Show","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814kB5wbh2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Absorbent - The bathroom mat is made of high-density microfiber, which has super absorbent. Thick and shaggy floor mats can absorb water from your feet, keep your feet dry, and keep your bathroom clean and tidy. When you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink, high-pile, thick micro fabric helps absorb water quickly, so keep your floors dripping water away. Non-Slip TPR Backing - The bath mats for non-slip bathroom ​backing is used TPR material, which can fit the floor and is not easy to slide around. Unique backing texture design and expensive TPR rubber, which is much stronger and more durable for long-lasting use. Please place the non-skid toilet rug on a dry, smooth floor only. Water under the bathroom rug can cause it to slip. Keep the bottom of the bath rug dry. Multi-Purpose Use - The bathroom rugs are easy to go with any home decor, perfect for nearly any space in your bathroom. Works in front of your single or double sink, shower, bathtub, or anywhere else you want to support and warmth on your toes. It can be applied in the bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, door entrances, stairs, balcony, laundry room, pet house, pet rug, and more. Extra Soft and Warm - Our bath rugs are made of 100% ultra-soft 1 inch tall plush chenille microfiber, which keeps your feet nice and warm. Softer and longer shag, designed for maximum moisture absorption, soft chenille shag protects your feet and relieves pressure and fatigue on your feet. Keep your floors dry, and ensures you don't slip after your bath or shower. Machine Washable - Bathroom floor mats are easy to clean. Machine wash with cold water and mild detergent, and hang to air dry or in the dryer at the lowest heat setting. Do not use chlorine or bleach. The colors will stay vibrant after many washes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814kB5wbh2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRANNY SAYS","source_asin":"B0BNVBLMZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVBLMZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVBLMZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
