window.products.push({"id":318541,"name":"Amposei One Way Mirror Window Film, Window Privacy Film Heat Control Anti UV Static Cling Tint Reflective Non-Adhesive for Glass Door Home Office Dayt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HUOXPMDaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UV Blocking Window Privacy Film A privacy window makes you enjoy the sun during the day without affecting your indoor privacy. When interior turns on light at night, The mirror-effect will be reversed since the interior is exposed to more light than the exterior. It means that the inside could be seen through outside at night, you can pull down the curtain. The sun's ultraviolet rays are responsible for both tanning and burning.It's the culprit of freckles.  This window film can also effectively suppress ultraviolet rays with the additional UV solvent layer. Since its great heat control effect, our window film can Keep your room in a relevant comfort temperature which has a great meaning in energy saving and environment protection. Installation Instructions: Step 1: Measuring the size of the window. Step 2: Measuring the size of the solar film and cut it. Step 3: Remove the static film from backing protect sheet. Step 4: Keep window or glass clean and Spray the window or glass with water (Soapy water will be the best choice). Step 5: When you install it, apply to wet glass and smooth with hand. Step 6: Spray the window or glass with water again. Step 7: Attaching the protect sheet to the window film. Step 8: Squeegee away air bubbles and redundant water. Step 9: After Scraping, Remove the protect sheet. Step 10: Cut the excess edges. Step 11: Dry the window film with a cloth. Step 12: Finished. Useful Tips: 1. When cutting the window film, note that the size of the cut is 1-2 cm larger than the actual one-sided size of the window. 2. Before pasting, remember to tear off the protective film and spray a lot of water.  3. Attaching the protect sheet first, then use the squeegee to scrape the bubbles to prevent the squeegee from scratching the surface of the film. Package Including 1 x Window Privacy Film Black Grey","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HUOXPMDaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amposei","source_asin":"B01FLQRS3O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FLQRS3O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FLQRS3O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":318542,"name":"Sanyo SK-7W Space Saving Toaster Oven, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4120ZQAQTDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description White 2-Level Super Toasty(TM) Oven - SANYO TWO LEVEL TOASTER OVEN WHITE Amazon.com With the high expense of electricity, it can be costly to turn on a full-size oven for quick toasting and browning tasks. This toaster oven is a simple answer to keep electrical costs down. Use it for toasting bagels that don't always fit in a conventional toaster, or for melting cheese over a favorite sandwich. It can even be used for browning the tops of individual meringue tarts. Standing 13 inches high by 9 inches wide by 8-1/2 inches deep (including the handles), it obviously doesn't require too much counter space. It lets you select the specific elements--there are three: bottom, middle, and top--needed for a particular task. The oven also comes with a 15-minute safety auto shut-off, which is helpful for the busy and easily distracted teenager who maybe preparing their own after school snack. As a precaution, the oven should always be unplugged from the power source when it's not in use or when it's being cleaned. --Teresa Simanton","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4120ZQAQTDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SANYO","source_asin":"B0002MV35C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002MV35C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002MV35C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":318543,"name":"Sleepwish Eiffel Tower Paris Printed Sofa Slip Covers, 3 Cushion Couch, Loveseat Or Arm Chair Slipcover Furniture Cover Cushion Sofa Slipcovers with 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qds2hT9IL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"All Sofa Slipcovers Are NOT The Same Let’s face it. You’ve got a problem with the way your couch looks. Either it’s just too BORING, too old, or too damaged for you to feel happy about it anymore. You want to spruce things up, and take your couch to the next level. The problem is, most sofa slipcover companies only make generic slipcovers instead of the designs that you really want. That’s why we’ve created the kind of designs that will really get you compliments and start a conversation. 24 Of The Greatest Couch Cover Designs Ever Dream Up Go ahead, and look through our selection of designs above. Have you ever seen ANYTHING like it? We’d be willing to bet not. We’ve assembled the most stunning, amazing, and totally unique designs that are trending in fashion these days so that you can express your unique sense of fashion. Easy Installation For Any Kind Of Furniture Just in case you are worried it might be difficult to install a slipcover like this on your couch or sofa, we’ve included a full instruction tag that walks you through the installation step by step to make sure you get it right. It is as easy as stretching the cover over your sofa and then fastening it using the included foam sticking blocks. If you follow the instructions, you won’t have any slippage, sagging, or difficulty installing your slipcover correctly. Our Slipcovers Fit ANY Style Of Couch Chair, (XL) sofa or loveseat. Finding the right size for YOUR furniture is easy – please use the measuring guide above to find the right slipcover for your couch. Go ahead, find the perfect design and the perfect-sized cover, and then upgrade your sofa! As an added bonus, we’ll throw in one free cushion cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qds2hT9IL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleepwish","source_asin":"B0BJ8QJ1RV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ8QJ1RV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ8QJ1RV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
