window.products.push({"id":318703,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, Easy Release Ice Tray BPA Free, 4 Pack 14-Ice Cube Tray with Lid, Stackable Silicone Ice Cube Mold, Suitable for Frozen Drinks, Coffee,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gpYzccBnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-grade Safety Material: Made of silicone and PP material, 4 packs ice trays are durable and easy-use. Each tray makes 14 nice-sized cubes for a total of 56. Bring customers the perfect cocktail and ice coffee experience at home. Silicone ice cube tray kits great for home use, parties, whisky and bars etc. Ice Cubes Easy Release: Let them sit for a few minutes before ice removal. Take out all the cubes and twist the tray gently. Press the silicone part of the bottom and pop the ice out. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. Stackable Design: These covered ice cube trays come with practical lids, which allows you to stack them in the freezer and save tons of space. The lids also keep the freezer smell and taste out of the water, so you can enjoy clear and clean ice cubes. Wide DIY: Except for cold food supply, these ice cube trays can provide us with more: decorate party drinks, keep the seafood fresh, or store various food so as to be used easily later on. Perfect for home-use, parties, bars, beverage/dessert stores, creative food-making games with kids, and urgent care like cooling or cold compresses. Provide You Perfect Ice Cubes: 4 Pack of Ice Trays for freezer with lid. Each tray makes 14 cubes for a total of 56. About 1.8*1.3*0.9 inches each cubes and about 0.88 ounces of liquid. Provide you much more pleasant ice-making experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gpYzccBnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KINGSWERE","source_asin":"B0B3JB8JQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3JB8JQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3JB8JQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
