window.products.push({"id":318709,"name":"ArtToFrames Collage Photo Frame Double Mat with 3 - 8x10 Openings and Satin Black Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JSe0z-bfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your one-of-a-kind photos deserve one-of-a-kind frames, but visiting a custom frame shop can be time consuming and expensive. Art to Frames extensive and growing line of inexpensive multi opening Photo Mats will get you the look you want at a price you can afford. Our Photo Mats come in a variety of sizes and colors and can be custom made to your needs. Frame choices range from traditional to contemporary, with both single and multiple photo opening mat options. With our large selection of custom frame and mat choices, the design possibilities are limitless. When you're done, you'll have a unique custom framed photo that will look like you spent a fortune at a frame shop. Your frame will be delivered directly to your front door or sent as a gift straight to your recipient. Product SKU No. Double-Multimat-139-817/89-FRBW26079.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JSe0z-bfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtToFrames","source_asin":"B018MJPSHA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018MJPSHA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018MJPSHA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
