window.products.push({"id":318805,"name":"Aqua79 Hummingbird Sparkling Refrigerator Magnet - Silver Sparkling Charm Rhinestones Crystals Cute Sparkly Bird Animal Magnet for Kitchen Door Fridge","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TIxnDJKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE HUMMINGBIRD SPARKLING MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of fashionable edge and appeal to your cute collection of novelty magnets! Perfect shimmering home decor to add elegance to any surface that attracts magnets. Aqua79's Hummingbird Sparkling Fridge Magnet will attract anyone who sees the shining rhinestones and crystals. A must-have home and office accessory to use as convenient note holders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNET IS FOR SPARKLY NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home and office ornament for magnet collectors and animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique and decorative sparkling magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Includes 1 Aqua79 Sparkling Hummingbird Fridge Magnet. The collectible magnet features an elegant hummingbird 3D shape with sparkling clear rhinestones. The unique magnetic decor comes with realistic hummingbird details colored in elegant silver rhinestones, making it the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. The fun kitchen fridge magnet measures about 2Lx2.12Wx0.25H. HIGH-QUALITY BIRD SPARKLING MAGNET – Fun magnets for refrigerator are exquisitely made of premium quality zinc alloy construction and high-quality crystals with a strong magnet attached to the back of 3D-shaped hummingbird figure. The magnetic hummingbird figure looks elegant and enhanced by beautiful sparkling rhinestones. Use the beautifully designed hummingbird magnetic home decor to add a head-turning shimmering accessory to your notes. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD LIFE ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Hummingbird magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos and drawings. Perfect functional and multi-use magnet for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TIxnDJKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua79","source_asin":"B0B86LHRX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B86LHRX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B86LHRX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
