window.products.push({"id":318870,"name":"BINO Expandable Curved Shower Curtain Rod | Polished Chrome 48\" to 72\" Extendable Shower Rod | Adjustable Shower Curtain Rod with Screw-Mounted Hardwa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NIySFfljL._AC_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Your Shower: A shower curtain is a practical and inexpensive way to add privacy while bathing or showering. It will also prevent water and moisture from escaping to other parts of the bathroom when in the shower. Hanging gorgeous curtains can easily upgrade the look and feel of a room. All that's needed is a durable shower curtain rod to secure the curtain. Extra Shower Space: Our shower curtain rods for bathrooms are adjustable from 48 to 72 inches. Because of the curved design, the curtain rod creates that extra space out front by up to 10 1/2 inches. It's a clever way to increase the area within the shower and prevent the curtain from coming close to you when showering. Durable Shower Rod: Our BINO curved shower rods for bathrooms are made from high-quality and durable materials with a brushed nickel finish. They're made to be rust and moisture-resistant to last longer. The nickel finish gives the shower curtain rod its sophisticated look. Easy Installation: Our adjustable curtain rod comes with screw-mounting hardware and a manual for easy installation. The easy-to-follow instructions come with illustrations, allowing you to install it or hire a professional to do it. Multi-purpose: The BINO extendable curtain rod is primarily designed as a functional and adjustable curtain rod for the bathroom, shower stall, and bathtub. You can also install the curtain rods in a closet, window opening, balcony, or changing area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NIySFfljL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B01C65MXHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C65MXHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C65MXHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
