window.products.push({"id":318889,"name":"Bsigo Gooseneck Electric Kettle with Thermometer, 100% Stainless Steel for Pour-over Coffee & Tea Kettle, BPA Free, Auto Shut off Anti-dry Protection,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tnAE70LEL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","description":"【Practical Gooseneck Spout】Bsigo electric kettle is designed with a gooseneck spout for precision control during pouring. The long and slender opening can greatly control the water flow to give a steady and predictable pour so that you can perfectly extract to enjoy a good cup of coffee, tea or milk. Great for pour over coffee, drip or manual coffee brewing. 【Thermometer Display & Safety Features】: Integraded thermometer displays ideal brewing temperature, this unique feature helps you to easily determine a suitable temperature you want for your coffee or tea. This hot water boiler has both boil-dry and overheating protection together with an auto-shut off providing maximum safety while the kettle is operating unattended. 【1000W High Power & Quick Boiling】The power of this electric water kettle is 1000W, faster boiling. You can quickly boil 0.8L of water in 4-6 minutes, saving your time when making coffee, tea, and instant drinks. 【Safe Food Grade Protective】Our hot water kettles are made of safe food grade protective material BPA free, in contact with water in this electric kettle are made of food-grade stainless steel 304. 【Humanization Design】One-touch on/off switch is easy to operate this kettle, and the ergonomic design allows the kettle to be easily lifted off for pouring after the water boiling. The cool touch and grip design of handle can ergonomically give you a real and comfortable grip on your kettle. The one-touch on/off button with a light indicator makes operation simple while the cord rotating base provides for easy filling and placement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tnAE70LEL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bsigo","source_asin":"B0BHKP96SZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHKP96SZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHKP96SZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
