window.products.push({"id":318962,"name":"Floating Beads No Hole Pearl for Vases, Highlight Pearls Bead Vase Filler for Centerpieces, Dreamy Purple Pearls 150 PCS, 30mm 20mm and 14mm, DIY Wedd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iHZ44ZwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dear Valued Customer, Create attractive Floating Beads Pearls centerpieces for your special day! Surprise your family, friends, and guests! These pearls beads use unique polishing and brightening technology. Great for your elegant events such as weddings, bridal showers, Valentine's Day, anniversaries, graduations, Mother's Day, and business socials! Important Questions and Answers Q:Why do the pearls sink or not float? A: You didn't use the Water Gels. Or you put too less Gel Beads in your vase and the pearls will sink. 18-20mm gel beads can effectively hold jumbo pearls. You can purchase our Notchis Water Gels. They will grow to 18-20mm size in the water. Q: Why my Water Gels are not Transparent? A: You didn't fully hydrate the Water Gels. Or you didn't pour water in your vase. The Water and Water Gels in vase will make your pearls look like floating. Q: How to hydrate the Water Gels? A: The beads require soaking in water for 6 hours. 1 L/1 quart/32oz of water: 1.5 tsp beads 64oz of water: 3 tsp beads 1 gallon of water: 5 tsp beads Q: How many pearls would I need to decorate 2 vases? A: It really depends on the size of your vase. An average vase size 4\" x 10\" a good amount is 15-25 pieces. 50 pearls can decorate about 2-3 4\" x 10\" large vases with water gel beads. Q: How to purchase water gels? A: Please search on Amazon: Notchis Water Gels. Q: What is our return policy? A: 100% Money-Back Guarantee: You can receive a fast, no-hassle refund. Material: Faux Pearl Specifications: Dreamy Purple Pearls Size: 4 jumbo (30mm/1.25”d), 14 large (20mm/0.75”d) and 32 medium (14mm/0.55”d) pearls Package Includes: 50 pcs Dreamy Purple Pearls 1 pcs Lable: Easy to follow instructions with illustrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iHZ44ZwOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOTCHIS","source_asin":"B0BPC1JQY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-318962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPC1JQY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPC1JQY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
